### Cassini JDK HttpServer Examples — IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Env : "local" (port 8080) ou "test"

### --- Greetings ---

### GET /greetings — Hello World
GET {{baseUrl}}/greetings
Accept: text/plain

###

### GET /greetings/{name} — Hello Alice
GET {{baseUrl}}/greetings/Alice
Accept: text/plain

###

### --- Todos ---

### GET /todos — liste vide
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Accept: application/json

###

### POST /todos — créer un todo
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "Buy milk",
  "done": false
}

###

### GET /todos/1 — récupérer le todo id=1
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/1
Accept: application/json

###

### PUT /todos/1 — mettre à jour le todo id=1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Buy oat milk",
  "done": true
}

###

### DELETE /todos/1 — supprimer le todo id=1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/1

###

### GET /todos/999 — 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/999
Accept: application/json

###
